{"id":"wb-8-369","name":"温县遇仙观","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T13:25:15+00:00","status":"ready","title":"遇仙观","text":"遇仙观位于中华人民共和国河南省焦作市温县武德镇徐堡村北、沁河堤下，距县城约十二公里，是一座由两进院落组成的道教宫观。观内以山门、玉皇殿和三清殿为中轴建筑，两侧配置多座神殿及钟楼，现存建筑主要为明清时期遗存。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%81%87%E4%BB%99%E8%A7%82","revisionId":95379150,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=95379150","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"复核名称、所在地与对应遗址；原名录行政地址及参考点位不作为唯一判断依据","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/180a594bc9bb7d1d08893cc6.jpg","title":"20240824_Yuxian_Guan_02.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20240824_Yuxian_Guan_02.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/56/20240824_Yuxian_Guan_02.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Windmemories","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​温县遇仙观","width":320,"height":213,"matchEvidence":"已复核文物对应百科条目的主图","subject":"遇仙观"}}